  "description": "Typed AI agents for .NET. Name the models, the tools and who they act for as types; ask a typed question, get a typed answer. Versionless models with fallback chains, tools with approvals and a context per conversation, streaming chats, and a cost on every call. Anthropic and OpenAI over their APIs, plus the local claude CLI on a developer's own subscription with no API key.",
